2.6 Responsibilities of Each Group
The groups performed the following duties:
•	Brooding chicks.
•	Feeding birds.
•	Watering birds.
•	Cleaning poultry houses.
•	Changing litter.
•	Monitoring bird health.
•	Vaccinating birds.
•	Recording mortality.
•	Measuring body weights.
•	Cleaning feeders and drinkers.
•	Marketing birds.
•	Maintaining financial records.
